Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:28.20,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.68,0:00:30.68,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.53,0:00:45.77,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Almost time for the cherry blossoms to dissapear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.01,0:00:51.99,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow's a holiday, so let's all go flower viewing together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.37,0:00:55.99,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,That sounds fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.99,0:00:57.52,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I should make packed lunches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.18,0:00:59.97,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'll make some too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.97,0:01:01.60,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds great!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.60,0:01:03.42,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.07,0:01:09.98,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry! I decided all by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.98,0:01:13.65,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Not a problem. It's fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.65,0:01:15.44,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bring something along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:17.32,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.52,0:01:27.52,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki is always causing trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.52,0:01:30.49,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.88,0:01:33.50,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki! Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:38.44,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's meet tomorrow at 8 in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.44,0:01:39.16,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.89,0:01:41.22,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's way too early!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.22,0:01:42.72,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,9 o'clock, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:45.12,Usaghi Main,Nitani,0000,0000,0000,,You're supposed to go flower viewing in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:50.34,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? Fine, 10 o'clock, but I need to watch Gransazer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:50.34,TL Note,TL note,0000,0000,0000,,Gransazer is a Power Rangers-type franchise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.43,0:01:53.79,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That decides it. We'll go in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.42,0:02:02.42,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.08,0:02:05.22,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, where's the water bottle?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.22,0:02:07.57,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It should be under the sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.57,0:02:09.06,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:13.10,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like it might rain tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:17.90,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A spring storm, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.37,0:02:19.55,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A storm...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:25.34,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's already raining!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.26,0:02:30.25,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Woah, it's really coming down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:35.24,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let's make a teru teru bozu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:35.24,TL Note,TL note,0000,0000,0000,,Teru teru bozu: A small doll used as an amulet to bring good weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.82,0:02:59.19,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.49,0:03:05.45,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It stopped raining!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.45,0:03:07.23,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.06,0:03:10.41,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The teru teru bozu really worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.19,0:03:19.54,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if the blossoms are still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:29.94,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's the smell of nature!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.31,0:03:41.24,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The flowers are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.06,0:03:45.65,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.56,0:04:01.94,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.01,0:04:33.04,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The sky's in full bloom!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.56,0:04:40.62,Sign,Ep title,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(189,95)\fscx82.5\fscy108.75}「The Sky's in Full Bloom」
